  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S. Marico Limited Through Its ... vs The State Of Maharashtra on 13 December, 2018 911 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 911 Criminal Application No.3628 Of 2018 M/S. Marico Limited Through Its Authorized Signatory Ekta Binoo Sarin And Others Versus The State Of Maharashtra ... Advocate for Applicants : Mr. Bora Satyajit S. App for Respondent/State : Mr. Borade P.G. ... Coram : K. L. Wadane, J. Date : 13Th December, 2018",
    "facts": "The learned APP waives service of the notice for the sole-respondent. 2. The learned counsel for the applicants submits that on 27.04.1992, in all 10 samples Saffola Edible Oil were taken by the respondent and according to him, those were found adulterated.",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the applicant further submits that in all there were 10 complaints filed by the respondent/compliant with similar allegations for the offences punishable under Sections 7 and 16 read with 17 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 against the 911.odt applicant. The learned counsel for the applicant further submits that, out of above 10 complaints, 8 complaints are [LEAKAGE_MASK] and [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court and allegations of the complaint in the present matter are similar to the complaints already [LEAKAGE_MASK] and [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "The learned counsel for the applicant further submits that in all there were 10 complaints filed by the respondent/compliant with similar allegations for the offences punishable under Sections 7 and 16 read with 17 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 against the 911.odt applicant. The learned counsel for the applicant further submits that, out of above 10 complaints, 8 complaints are [LEAKAGE_MASK] and [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court and allegations of the complaint in the present matter are similar to the complaints already [LEAKAGE_MASK] and [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court.",
